# Modelfile for "generalist", the single model tag every Larkspur agent
# is configured to use (see the `model` field on each *agent value in
# agents.go). Built on top of gemma4:e2b.
#
# Ollama serves a model with a runtime context window of 4096 tokens by
# default, regardless of that model's own trained maximum, unless a
# Modelfile (or an API caller) says otherwise. Left at Ollama's default,
# larger prompts (e.g. prompts/plan_creator.md) can get silently
# truncated mid-generation instead of ever tripping Larkspur's own
# compaction.
#
# This Modelfile builds the generalist tag on top of gemma4:e2b with
# num_ctx raised to 32768, the minimum context window Larkspur requires
# (see minModelContextTokens in agents.go — RefreshAgentContextWindows
# refuses to trust a model reporting less). Larkspur reads this same
# value back from `ollama show generalist` to size its compaction
# thresholds, so a change to num_ctx here takes effect there
# automatically, as long as it stays at or above 32768. Apply it with:
#
#   ollama create generalist -f modelfiles/generalist.Modelfile
#
# then confirm with `ollama show generalist` (or `ollama ps` after a
# request) that the context window reports 32768.

FROM gemma4:e2b

PARAMETER num_ctx 32768
